WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.300
Ask for six slides, a comparison chart and speaker notes · typing 3×

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.867
Send the request to CLIO

00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:13.667
CLIO reads the source notes · idle waits omitted

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:17.000
CLIO writes and runs the deck builder · 3×

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
CLIO prepares the preview and publishes the first draft · 2×

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.367
Ask CLIO to fix the first draft’s contrast and spacing · typing 3×

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:30.667
Review the complete correction request before sending

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:35.700
Submit the actual correction request

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:40.733
CLIO inspects the reported layout problems

00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:46.733
After reviewing its render, CLIO corrects the cover text · 3×

00:00:46.733 --> 00:00:53.733
CLIO reviews the corrected deck and checks its speaker notes

00:00:53.733 --> 00:01:00.433
The corrected PowerPoint and PDF arrive · 2×

00:01:00.433 --> 00:01:07.500
Open the PowerPoint that CLIO generated

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:18.500
Open its PDF preview · 2×; idle pauses omitted

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:27.567
Briefly review the cover and comparison chart

00:01:27.567 --> 00:01:33.900
Check the next steps; the PowerPoint includes editable charts and notes
